From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Spatiand build <claude@prasetya.id>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:21:43 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 289/310] Spatiand: profiles, bookmarks, history, logins,
 settings and extensions shared

chrome/browser/spatiand reads and writes the files every Spatiand machine shares
(apps/spatimesh/, docs/spatimesh.md), so Chromium's own profile menu, bookmarks, history and settings
show and change the same things the other builds do. A locked profile's windows wait for its PIN or
password. A store that comes up without most of what was agreed takes it back from the folder rather
than removing it from every machine; clearing browsing data is told apart by the pref it now sets.
